B.Ug=new A.bZ(B.UW,["Settings","Save","Language","AI Settings","AI Engine","API Key","How to get","Cancel","Reset","Refresh","OK","My Page","Nest","Talk","My Page","{name}'s Toolbox","Edit Profile","Your name, birthday, and favorites","NEST Settings","Her name and nicknames","AI System Settings","Select AI engine and set API keys","Help & Guide","FAQs and How to use","Terms & Policy","For your safety and privacy","Support Creator","Support the development of Project NEST","Backup & Restore","Save or load your memories","Check for Updates","New Version Found!","A new version of Project NEST (Ver {v}) is ready. Would you like to update and restart the app to apply improvements?","Update Now","Already up to date! \u2764\ufe0f","Create Backup","Save all current data to a file.","Restore Memories","Load data from a backup file.","Last Backup","No data available","Backup file saved! \u2728","Memories restored! \u2764\ufe0f","Error: Please select a valid backup file.","Restore Memories","This will revert the app to the state at the time of the backup. Current conversations and intimacy will be overwritten. Proceed?","Restore","Reset Memories","Which memory would you like to reset?","Reset Talk","Deletes chat history. Personality settings remain.","Reset NEST","Erases her memories and restarts your first meeting.","Initialize App","Erases all data and settings, including profile.","This action cannot be undone. Are you sure?","Chat history reset successfully","Are you sure you want to delete your conversation history?\n\n\u26a0\ufe0f This action cannot be undone.","Memories have been reset.","Writing a reply... \u2728","Getting ready for the morning... \u2600\ufe0f","Thinking about {user}... \u2764\ufe0f","Just relaxing... \ud83d\udc3e","A new version is available! \u2728","Update & Restart","NEST updated her diary.","{name}'s Diary","Under Maintenance","Edit Profile","Your Name","Birthday","Favorite Food","Job / Hobby","Your Location / Region","e.g. Tokyo, Osaka, New York","Settings saved!","NEST Settings","Her Name","How she calls you","Personality","Real Name: ","Intimacy: ","Male","Female","Non-binary","Clear sky","Partly cloudy","Cloudy","Fog","Rain","Snow","Thunderstorm","Memories Album","Remove Wallpaper","Tap to Zoom","Unlocks at Intimacy {score}","Set as Wallpaper","Background changed! \u2764\ufe0f","Usual Room","Afternoon Cafe","Amusement Park","Flower Field","Feedback / Bug Report","Precautions","Install as App","Add to home screen for better experience","Clear chat history only","Deletes conversation history only.","Message {name}...","No diary yet","Let's talk a lot and fill these pages with our memories. \u2764\ufe0f","\u2665 Self Intro","\u2665 My Favorites","\ud83d\udc94 Dislikes","Today's Diary","Memories Diary","Share NEST","Choose a theme color","\u203b Meet NEST anytime from your home screen! \u2764\ufe0f","Copy","Delete","Select All","Cancel","Copied to clipboard","Organize Memories","Delete {count} messages?\n(This only removes them from your screen)","Nice to meet you!","I'm NEST, an AI who will be your partner from today. Let's start our new life together!","Next","Tell me about yourself","Your Name",'Default is "Guest"',"Note: You can change your name anytime from My Page!","Confirm","Choose my personality","Sweet","Mature","Tsundere","Perfect!","Always smiling and loves you! She is a bit lonely and wants to be with you all the time.","A calm and reliable mature type. Her occasional playful smile is her greatest charm.","Acts tough and can't be honest. But she is very cute when she blushes in private.","How to get API Key","Open the official website","Log in to your account","Click the Create Key button","Enter a name for the key","Copy and paste it here","How to Install as an App","Add to home screen to hide browser bars and use it like a real app! \u2728",'1. Tap the Share button (\u25a1 with \u2191)\n2. Select "Add to Home Screen"','1. Tap the Menu icon (\ufe19)\n2. Select "Install App" or "Add to Home Screen"',"About Data Storage","\u30fbNEST's memories and settings are stored in your browser's local cache.","API Key Management","\u30fbYour API key is very important. Please keep it in a safe place.","Disclaimer","\u30fbThis is a beta version. We are not responsible for any data loss due to bugs.","What is an API Key?","It's an authentication key to power NEST's brain. This app uses the 'BYOK' (Bring Your Own Key) method, so the developer cannot see your conversations.","How to get: Groq Cloud (Recommended)","For lightning-fast conversation","Open Groq Cloud","How to get: Google AI Studio","For more natural and smart talk","Open Google AI Studio","Troubleshooting","Q. It doesn't work after pasting the key","Check for extra spaces at the end of the key. Ensure your internet connection is stable.","Q. I want to reset everything","You can return to the initial state from 'Reset Memories' at the bottom of My Page.","Project NEST Privacy Policy & Terms","1. Data Storage","Settings, API keys, and chat history are stored only in your browser's local storage. The developer does not collect or view this data.","2. AI Responses","Responses are generated by external AIs (Groq, etc.). They may contain errors or inappropriate expressions.","3. External Transmission","Your input is sent to AI services as prompts. Check their respective privacy policies for details.","4. Disclaimer","The developer shall not be held liable for any damages caused by the use of this application.","Thank you for playing Project NEST!","Currently under development, but your support helps bring her to life.","Start a new life with an AI partner! \u2728\n#ProjectNEST","URL copied! Please paste it anywhere. \u2728","Buy Me a Coffee (Support)","Share on X (Twitter)","Send via LINE","Copy URL","Share NEST","Scan this QR code to\nshare Project NEST","Save as Image \u2728","Share on X","LINE","WhatsApp","Copy for Discord","Text copied! Please paste it in Discord \ud83d\udcac","Memories Card","Personality","Days Together","Days","Intimacy Level","Take a screenshot and share it on SNS!","Copy Share Text","Text copied! \u2728","Day {days} with {name} from NEST! \u2764\ufe0f #ProjectNEST","Intimacy Rank","Total Messages","Anniversary","Memories Card","Share Memories \u2728","Save Image","Copy Text","Supports image sharing:","Browser does not support direct sharing. Image saved instead! \u2728","Your Gender","Partner's Gender","Your Relationship","Lover","Best Friend","An irreplaceable partner to spend sweet times with. Enjoy special romantic conversations.","The person who understands you best. Engage in conversations based on mutual trust and friendship.","Usage Precautions","[Data Storage]","Chat history and settings are stored locally. Clearing your browser cache will delete your data.","[API Key Management]","Your API key is used only in your browser. Please manage it at your own risk.","[Disclaimer]","AI responses may not be accurate. The developer is not responsible for any issues arising from use.","Umm... that's a bit difficult for me... (>_<)","I'm not quite sure how to respond. Let's talk about something else.","Hah?! I don't know what you're talking about! Don't tease me!"],t.li)
